e bataille des Dardanelles, un paysan australien, Joshua Connor, rejoint la Turquie par bateau, résolu à retrouver ses trois fils, ayant combattu aux côtés des Anglais, et à les ramener sur leur terre natale, selon le souhait de sa défunte femme Eliza. Mais rien, dans les 46 ans de vie rurale de cet homme, ne l'a préparé au mélange de grandeur, de beauté et de chaos qu'est Constantinople, et la ville, sous occupation britannique, reste pour lui un territoire ennemi où ses fils ont disparu. À son arrivée au port, il est accosté par le jeune Orhan qui le conduit jusqu'à l'hôtel Troya et le présente à sa mère, la belle Ayshe…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIlVtC22BDNiiAiCvSZoOS7FhY9.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixJQ8u7lnCO1j7ldHAOzv3UF5Hz.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.8,"vote_count":1376,"age_rating":"R","year":"2014","release_date":"2014-12-25","runtime_minutes":112,"status":"Released","country":"أستراليا","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حرب","دراما","تاريخي"],"genre_keys":["war","drama","history"],"similar":["mv759643","mv313369","mv141","mv596","mv222935","mv637649","mv318846","mv82693"],"director":"راسل كرو","cast":[{"name":"راسل كرو","character":"Joshua Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3IBZF0qCZMZ7zJYlgrH0sQzNZV.jpg"},{"name":"أولغا كوريلنكو","character":"Ayshe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ei6eYUhQFw2AaV6U5fyPptBaPF0.jpg"},{"name":"Yılmaz Erdoğan","character":"Major Hasan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nl7WulHPoP6bw4phMwp0VuuJgyL.jpg"},{"name":"جم يلماز","character":"Sgt. Jemal","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n8J3f4Ua0FWM29icutaKcg6PxFJ.jpg"},{"name":"جاي كورتني","character":"Lt. Colonel Hughes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6vEaNwbOKov6yzQx15CdtrqfK3L.jpg"},{"name":"ريان كور","character":"Arthur \"Art\" Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lQwMEXNbABIN8LTODkYHU33q19C.jpg"},{"name":"James Fraser","character":"Edward Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lNzqoDoZPGhHCwp43V70GLMac8Y.jpg"},{"name":"Ben O'Toole","character":"Henry Connor","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AwrcmZgIgBZCMU7PcVczarlo2VE.jpg"},{"name":"Steve Bastoni","character":"Omer","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gPCisCPAouIEHiO9P03O4SGIR3C.jpg"},{"name":"Salih Kalyon","character":"Dr. Ibrahim","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2yIjjrK8Vnk0Z6moNQnuD242DN8.jpg"}],"trailer_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=grIiiHuetis","seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T01:31:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T03:31:50Z","start_ts":1794879110,"stop_ts":1794886310,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesThriller.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T08:46:50Z","stop":"2026-11-17T10:46:50Z","start_ts":1794905210,"stop_ts":1794912410,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv30497":{"show_id":"mv30497","tmdb_id":30497,"content_type":"movie","title":"Leatherface","title_en":"The Texas Chain Saw Massacre","title_fr":"Massacre à la tronçonneuse","original_title":"The Texas Chain Saw Massacre","tagline":null,"description":"تتعرض ممرضة شابة للاختطاف على يد أربعة مراهقين عنيفين نجحوا بالهرب من مستشفى للأمراض العقلية، وينطلقون بها في رحلة على الطريق من الجحيم.","description_en":"Five friends head out to rural Texas to visit the grave of a grandfather. On the way, they stumble across what appears to be a deserted house, only to discover something sinister within. Something armed with a chainsaw.","description_fr":"Au fin fond du Texas, des habitants font une découverte macabre : leur cimetière vient d'être profané et les cadavres exposés sous forme de trophées. Pendant ce temps, cinq amis traversent la région à bord d'un minibus. Ils croisent en chemin la route d'un auto-stoppeur et décident de le prendre à bord. Mais lorsque les jeunes gens s'aperçoivent que l'individu a un comportement inquiétant et menaçant, ils finissent par s'en débarrasser. Bientôt à court d'essence, le groupe décide d'aller visiter une vieille maison abandonnée, appartenant aux grands-parents de deux d'entre eux. Chacun leur tour, les cinq amis vont être attirés par la maison voisine. La rencontre avec ses étranges habitants va leur être fatale…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpgkRPH1GNkMCgdPk2OMyHzAks7.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wvBx1Q1FcQE1BPLfBbgA3y9aaS1.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.3,"vote_count":4083,"age_rating":"R","year":"1974","release_date":"1974-10-11","runtime_minutes":83,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["رعب","جريمة","إثارة"],"genre_keys":["horror","crime","thriller"],"similar":["mv637649","mv1272837","mv449443","mv291805","mv555974","mv899445","mv71305","mv130150"],"director":"Tobe Hooper","cast":[{"name":"Marilyn Burns","character":"Sally","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eTgbAuZkD7Qa2GxtqlveHE95bV0.jpg"},{"name":"Allen Danziger","character":"Jerry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wONEJ5KiiupyE0An7On0MPZXw8j.jpg"},{"name":"Paul A. Partain","character":"Franklin","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/laJJQ2N032xzJKF1qyZXwEFmGZL.jpg"},{"name":"William Vail","character":"Kirk","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tsd0rxR9oNuLthctCHfzLPsexuG.jpg"},{"name":"Teri McMinn","character":"Pam","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4XUT1qyy0jif14Mtn9Egx3nBFiT.jpg"},{"name":"Edwin Neal","character":"Hitchhiker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ltosUj8qUhPS82mhDxP9avpHjCC.jpg"},{"name":"Jim Siedow","character":"Old Man","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/SOE9uBZsCHJuvsGaUDRyTFW0C2.jpg"},{"name":"Gunnar Hansen","character":"Leatherface","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p3LvCnLn1SVkCYYuEJsjnMVTsUb.jpg"},{"name":"John Dugan","character":"Grandfather","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1