ل آخر.","description_en":"The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There's only one catch - he didn't write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man's work, and for placing ambition and success above life's most fundamental three words.","description_fr":"Cooper, un jeune écrivain, découvre dans un attaché-case acheté par sa femme (Saldaña) un manuscrit à la façon d'Hemingway perdu par son auteur (Irons), qu'il va publier sous son propre nom, devenant ainsi célèbre. Au sommet de sa gloire, l'écrivain découvre le prix à payer pour avoir volé le travail d’un autre.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lKZ9QdzMEIceI2PUnFCjZNq1JIg.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.7,"vote_count":1351,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2012","release_date":"2012-09-07","runtime_minutes":102,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","إثارة","رومانسي","غموض"],"genre_keys":["drama","thriller","romance","mystery"],"similar":["mv130150","mv536437","mv71305","mv313369","mv141","mv222935","mv637649","mv82693"],"director":"Brian Klugman, Lee Sternthal","cast":[{"name":"برادلي كوبر","character":"Rory Jansen","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5Dhy50qOMOHfR1NZifKIfffjV9X.jpg"},{"name":"زوي سالدانا","character":"Dora Jansen","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vQBwmsSOAd0JDaEcZ5p43J9xzsY.jpg"},{"name":"جيرمي أيرونز","character":"The Old Man","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w8Ct1q02Ht3sWdOSqfp3B85TzT.jpg"},{"name":"دينيس كويد","character":"Clay Hammond","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lMaDAJHzsKH7U3dln2B3kY3rOhE.jpg"},{"name":"أوليفيا وايلد","character":"Danielle","profile_image":"https